      "content": "Those are a good start, but they're a little too vague. My boss wants something with a bit more substance. Can you make them a bit more specific about why the stability of a traditional home (like a mom, dad, and kids) provides a better foundation than the more unconventional or fragmented setups we see a lot of these days? We want to highlight that stability without being too aggressive.",
